Changelog: 17-11-2026 12:04:47

Added. BC-250 Password Generator (apps/password), a new app in Utilities: a random password of 8 or 15 characters with a capital
letter, a small letter, a number and a special character, kept nowhere, with Copy to the clipboard for 60 seconds.
It is listed in the portal, the wiki, the README, the bug report and the Dependency Checker's catalog, and has its
installer test.

Changelog: 16-11-2026 18:57:21

Added. tools/text_check.py lists what is wrong with the text people read: the wiki, the READMEs, the text in the
apps' windows, the portal's texts in portal/apps.toml and the messages the apps' scripts print. It checks the text
against the writing standard in .claude/writing.md, with LanguageTool (spelling, grammar and American English, in
a podman container) and with Vale (style and readability). It is no test and no CI check. In Claude Code,
/rewrite-text rewrites the text with it and checks every changed sentence against the code. The owner's decisions
on the text are in .claude/text-decisions.md.

